    {"symbol": "📸", "tooltip": "A passing test suite is a snapshot, not a maintenance guarantee — it proves the photo, not the life of the system afterward."},
    {"symbol": "👍", "tooltip": "A mandated audit trail collapses into a rubber-stamp emoji when over-trust replaces actual review."}
  ],
