    {"claim": "Developers rubber-stamp AI-generated pull requests at elevated rates with LGTM-only reviews, so you get a queryable artifact that nobody queries.", "targets": [], "relationship": ""},
    {"claim": "The productivity gain is the unmeasured quantity in this room, while integration-stage failure is the survey-documented one.", "targets": [], "relationship": ""},
    {"claim": "The cost I'm naming is institutional knowledge erosion — the team's own craft hollowing out one rubber-stamped merge at a time.", "targets": [], "relationship": ""}
