    {"claim": "It converts a total reconstructive burden into an instrumented one: a reproducible test suite plus a queryable decision log is a recoverable substrate that a lossy Slack archive never was.", "targets": ["AN-12"]},
    {"claim": "The Skeptic cannot keep both the bounded stipulation and the irreversible-by-the-back-door debt claim — so which one goes?", "targets": ["AN-11", "AN-12"]}
  ],
